WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,900
And just now I used silver coins to trade for two units of iron chopsticks.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,500
Four sisters in our dormitory share a room.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,700
You can upgrade the third-level door soon

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,980
Sister Bai is indeed the top student in our high school.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,250
Four people sharing a room

6
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,730
There are twelve silver coins and four talents at the beginning.

7
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,610
No wonder you can upgrade to the third level immediately

8
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:22,010
It turns out that cooperation is the correct way for human beings to survive

9
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:24,410
It would be great if Chen Ai could obediently be my assistant.

10
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:26,450
Her talent matches my strength

11
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,810
The upgrade is definitely faster than those four high school students

12
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:30,810
It's a pity that she is too determined

13
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,130
Find someone else

14
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:34,250
Boys don’t listen to girls’ words

15
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,970
There seems to be a timid and introverted girl named Lin Lucy on the mountain

16
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,130
Easier to control

17
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,350
But how to find it?

18
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,790
Hundreds of rooms on one floor

19
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,390
It's definitely not possible to knock on the door one by one.

20
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:45,550
That classmate

21
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,580
Are you really not considering joining our team?

22
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,340
Our team already has twenty-nine people

23
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,940
It is the largest team on the ninth floor
